        name: "Ko-fi API",
        description: `Ingests Ko-fi donations, recurring memberships, shop purchases, and commissions in real time.
            <div style="margin-top: 10px; padding: 12px 14px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); font-size: 0.88em; line-height: 1.6;">
