                    <button class="btn-green" onclick="window.TheaterController.modules.kofi_api.definition.openKofiWebhooks()" style="font-size: 0.85em; padding: 5px 12px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; border: none; background: #3b82f6; color: #fff; font-weight: bold;">🔗 Open Ko-fi Webhook Settings</button>
