                    <li>Click <strong style="color:#fff;">🔗 Open Ko-fi Webhook Settings</strong> (or go to <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="window.TheaterController.modules.kofi_api.definition.openKofiWebhooks()" style="color: #38bdf8; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;">ko-fi.com/manage/webhooks ↗</a>) and paste the URL into <strong>Webhook URL</strong>.</li>
